{"What has happened to me? Why am I so alone in the world? \0034:30 A.M.\004—The solution came to me, just as I was dozing off. Illuminated! Everything fits together, and I see what I should have known from the beginning. No more sleep. I’ve got to get back to the lab and test this against the results from the computer. This, finally, is the flaw in the experiment. I’ve found it.","Flowers for Algernon","Daniel Keyes",true},
